body: "## Outcome\nA written, testable stability contract for the CLI grammar, the SDK API, the storage format, and the published scale targets.\n\n## Gate semantics\nThis milestone is a gate, not a workstream: it cannot open until the grammar, SDK-complete, and provable-history milestones are reached, and its scale claims are limited to what the scale milestone has actually measured.\n\n## Delivery chain\nADR pm-agou drafts the contract -> pm-0mox alias usage counters supply removal evidence -> the cross-version compatibility matrix supplies format evidence -> benchmark evidence supplies the scale numbers.\n\n## Explicit non-goals\nNot a feature freeze. Not a marketing event — messaging lives under pm-wjfa."
